libmpcdec, the Musepack decoder library, from the Musepack source release r475
(https://files.musepack.net/source/musepack_src_r475.tar.gz), the decoder files (libmpcdec/ and
include/mpc/) only, unmodified. BSD 3-clause licence (see COPYING). Built for core B with
MPC_FIXED_POINT (no FPU) and -fcommon (the headers declare tables without extern); the few C
library functions it uses outside decoding (pow, log10, sprintf, the SV8 CRC32 of common/crc32.c)
are provided by fw/hifi/codec_mpc.c. ETUDE §61.
